# max-insns: 900_000_000
# temple-heal: the battle-aftermath fight (the party comes out wounded: Bakshi is down), leave the treasure screen, walk to the temple
# (map 20, cell 1,3) and use its services on Bakshi: Cure Light Wounds is paid for, the other services are asked for and refused or
# declined (Cure Serious and Critical Wounds, Neutralize Poison, Raise Dead, Remove Curse, Stone to Flesh). Covers ovl04 (HealMenu,
# CureWounds, RaiseDead, ...), ovl21 money, ovl22/ovl24 for the cure spells and the End-of-fight menus. Found with the coverage-guided
# explorer; the temple menu moves with Home/End and Enter. Shots follow a key at once.
